<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Don Group details results of cap award.</title>
<headline>Don Group details results of cap award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Don Group Ltd announced on Tuesday that shareholders representing some 2.6 million shares had elected to receive the company's cash dividend of four cents a share.</p>
<p>As a result, the hotel and leisure company said some 243,824 new shares would be issued and listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange with effect from October 16.</p>
<p>Share certificates and dividend cheques would be posted on the same date.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
